@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/messages/[message_uuid]
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/messages/{message_uuid}
API -> DB: resolve public placement; check active membership + generation
API -> DB: delete canonical MESSAGE root + immutable outbox events
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: read_counters / reaction_snapshot /\ndelivery_snapshot_event\n每一个 task 有自己的 outbox_event_uuid
Worker -> Worker: topic: placements; user-stream/user-folder: aggregates
Worker -> Projection: 容器在清理后的外钥匙计数器
Worker -> Events: message.deleted + 容器事件\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over API,Worker
  Public ID = MESSAGE_PLACEMENT.uuid; canonical root 删除
  只有在 permission check 通过 active membership.
  Lease/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note
@enduml
